Now we need to also establish clearance for shift_candidate_beta. There are several establish_clearance_* actions. They require candidate_loading_verified, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, and either origin_leg_loaded/destination_leg_loaded or not.

